---
title: "execute (Compound V2: Governor Bravo)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_state_check: proposalState = state(proposalId)
    q_state_check --> q_not_queued: proposalState != Queued
    q_not_queued --> [*]: revert "proposal can only be executed if it is queued"
    q_state_check --> q_iter: proposalState == Queued
    q_iter --> q_execute_action: for each action in proposal
    q_execute_action --> q_call: timelock.executeTransaction(target, value, signature, data, eta)
    q_call --> q_call_fail: execution reverts
    q_call_fail --> [*]: revert "transaction execution reverted"
    q_call --> q_iter: execution succeeds; next action
    q_iter --> q_finalize: all actions executed
    q_finalize --> [*]: proposal.executed = true; emit ProposalExecuted(proposalId)

    note right of q_state_check
        INV-001: Proposal must be in Queued state
        INV-002: Timelock enforces block.timestamp >= eta (delay has passed)
        INV-003: Timelock enforces block.timestamp <= eta + gracePeriod (not expired)
    end note

    note right of q_execute_action
        INV-004: Actions execute atomically; if one reverts, all revert
        INV-005: Function is payable (can forward ETH to target contracts)
        INV-006: Anyone can call execute on a queued proposal after delay
    end note
